sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A0 as Runtime
  participant A1 as Model Gateway
  participant A2 as Policy
  participant A3 as Self-hosted
  participant A4 as External
  A0->>A1: Identity + policy + messages
  A1->>A2: Classification / allowed resources
  A2->>A1: Approved route set
  A1->>A3: Confidential / restricted allowed route
  A3->>A1: Canonical response
  A1->>A4: Only if classification policy permits
  A4->>A1: Normalized response
  A1->>A0: Result / fail closed if no safe route

